<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">10072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In southern China, the Liulan reservoir gave way under record rainfall... and twenty-six people were swept to their deaths in the water that followed.</s>
<s>The breach has driven the flood toll across Guangxi to thirty-nine dead and nine missing — and a dam that fails is not an act of nature but an accountability gap, a question of maintenance and warning left unanswered.</s>
<s>A second, larger storm is already closing on the coast, testing infrastructure the floods have broken.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Iran, the slain supreme leader Ayatollah Khamenei has been buried in Mashhad — but the man named to succeed him hasn't been seen in public since February.</s>
<s>Mojtaba Khamenei was disfigured in the strike that killed his father, and state security is now shielding him from further American attacks.</s>
<s>His recovery, not the burial, may decide who commands a nuclear-threshold state in the middle of a war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Six more Palestinians were killed by Israeli strikes in Gaza, just hours after Hamas dissolved the committee that had governed the territory for two decades.</s>
<s>The group framed it as removing any pretext for continued war, handing administration to a technocratic national committee.</s>
<s>And still the strikes continued... the dead are the story, and the stated rationale for killing them has outlived the reason given.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In South Africa, marchers have begun raiding factories and homes, demanding papers and beating anyone they brand a foreigner.</s>
<s>Coalitions like March and March now claim inspection powers the state says they don't hold, six months before a national election.</s>
<s>When citizens seize the work of enforcement, xenophobia hardens into vigilante violence — and the migrant workers who bleed for it have no recourse.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Off Japan's southwestern edge, Typhoon Bavi is bearing down on the remote Sakishima Islands with winds of a hundred and sixty-two kilometres an hour.</s>
<s>Dozens of flights are grounded across this sparse chain near Taiwan, Japan's first line of exposure to an intensifying Pacific storm season.</s>
<s>For these outer islands, the real cost is severed air links and supply lines that no one on the mainland will feel.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Mumbai, one housing society watched its stamp duty fall from a hundred and one crore rupees to just over ten lakh.</s>
<s>Maharashtra state capped the duty on ninety-nine-year leases at half a percent, down from five, unlocking registrations frozen for decades on India's costliest property market.</s>
<s>A single change to a tax rate turns legally-stranded homes into assets thousands of families can finally mortgage and sell.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australia's Telstra suffered a nationwide outage on Wednesday that knocked out trains, payments, and even triple-zero emergency calls.</s>
<s>Chief executive Vicki Brady blames a software glitch, not job cuts, and says executive bonuses will now be reviewed.</s>
<s>The question is whether the pay of those who run critical infrastructure moves when it fails — and no date has been set to find out.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Qatari-flagged gas tanker, the Al Rekayyat, caught fire after an attack on the Omani side of the Strait of Hormuz.</s>
<s>No laden liquefied-gas carrier has ever exploded at sea, and this narrow strait carries about a fifth of the world's shipments.</s>
<s>One breached hull could reprice global gas overnight — industry sources say the vessel should hold, unless it's struck again.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan, regulators refused to let two insolvent state gas utilities hide their books.</s>
<s>Exempting them from new accounting rules would have concealed three point four four trillion rupees of gas-sector debt as fiction rather than real recovery.</s>
<s>The petroleum division must now go back and submit a revised proposal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Singapore now charges nearly a hundred thousand dollars for a permit simply to own a car.</s>
<s>The city-state auctions a fixed quota of ownership certificates, engineering scarcity on purpose to curb congestion on scarce land.</s>
<s>Each new round of bidding can push that record higher, with no ceiling anywhere in sight.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In the eastern Mediterranean, sperm whales click to a faster tempo than their cousins in the western basin.</s>
<s>Researchers analysed five thousand two hundred and ninety-one click sequences near Greece's Hellenic Trench and found a distinct dialect of the shared call.</s>
<s>A dialect boundary inside a single sea implies culture that's learned, not inherited — and no one yet knows why eastern whales sometimes slip back to the older pattern.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Ebola outbreak in the Democratic Republic of Congo has now killed six hundred people.</s>
<s>Cases rose twenty-five percent in a single week as insecurity in North Kivu blocks emergency teams from reaching the sick, the <sub alias="Africa Centres for Disease Control">Africa CDC</sub> says.</s>
<s>The agency wants half again as many treatment beds to blunt a virus still spreading faster than it can be contained.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Britain, doctors found that family-history rules were missing half of the women carrying high-risk breast-cancer genes.</s>
<s>A pilot tested three thousand five hundred and fifteen unselected patients and caught only forty-nine percent of dangerous mutations under the old criteria.</s>
<s>Simpler rules could lift detection to eighty-one percent — deciding, for many, whether they learn their own risk in time.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The creator of the Zig programming language has gone public against Bun, the runtime that recently rewrote itself in Rust.</s>
<s>Andrew Kelley says Bun's venture-backed sprint drew talent away from Zig before walking off, in a post that drew hundreds of developers into the thread.</s>
<s>It reopens an old and unresolved question — which systems language can actually sustain a runtime for the long term.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>